l-3.48-4.35A1 1 0 0 0 17.52 8H14\"></path><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle><circle cx=\"7\" cy=\"18\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg> <span>53&#x27; Dry Van FTL</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#34D399\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-thermometer\"><path d=\"M14 4v10.54a4 4 0 1 1-4 0V4a2 2 0 0 1 4 0Z\"></path></svg> <span>Temp-Controlled Cold Chain (-20°F)</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#FBBF24\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-alert\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M12 8v4\"></path><path d=\"M12 16h.01\"></path></svg> <span>55-Ton Heavy Haul RGN</span></div><div class=\"header-stat-pill\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#C084FC\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-warehouse\"><path d=\"M22 8.35V20a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8.35A2 2 0 0 1 3.26 6.5l8-3.2a2 2 0 0 1 1.48 0l8 3.2A2 2 0 0 1 22 8.35Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 18h12\"></path><path d=\"M6 14h12\"></path><rect width=\"12\" height=\"12\" x=\"6\" y=\"10\"></rect></svg> <span>3.2M Sq. Ft. Warehousing &amp; Cross-Dock</span></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:3.5rem\"><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2, 1fr);gap:2.25rem\"><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--color-border);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);display:fle