-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Continuous Temp Monitoring (-20°F to +70°F with ±0.5°F Variance)</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Multi-Temperature Zone Partitioning for Mixed Cargo</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>FDA FSMA &amp; GDP Compliant Operational Standards</span></li></ul><div style=\"margin-top:auto;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:600\">SLA: <!-- -->Zero Temp Excursion SLA</span><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:0.45rem 0.9rem;font-size:0.85rem\" href=\"/services/temperature-controlled-cold-chain\"><span>Technical Specs</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"luc