umn;gap:1.15rem;flex:1\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Contract Logistics &amp; Warehousing</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6\">3.2M sq. ft. of strategically located Class-A warehousing, cross-docking, inventory staging, and fulfillment hubs.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem\"><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>3.2M Sq. Ft. Across 6 Regional Logistics Hubs</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>WMS Real-Time Inventory Control (EDI 856 / 940 / 945 Compliant)</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Same-Day Cross-Docking &amp; Pool Distribution Services</span></li></ul><div style=\"margin-top:auto;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:600\">SLA: <!-- -->99</span><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:0.45rem 0.9rem;font-size:0.85rem\" href=\"/services/warehousing-contract-logistics\"><span>Technical Specs</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--color-border);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between\"><div style=\"height:210px;background-image:url(https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1542282088-72c9c27ed0cd?auto=format&amp;fit=crop&amp;q=80&amp;w=1200);background-size:cover;background-position:center;position:relative;padding:1.25rem;display:flex;align-items:flex-start\"><div style=\"background-color:rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.88);color:#FFFFFF;padding:0.45rem 0.85rem;border-radius:var(--radius-md);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><span>Expedited &amp; Time-Critical Cargo</span></div></div><div style=\"padding:1.75rem;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:1.15rem;flex:1\"><h3 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.45rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Expedited &amp; Time-Critical Cargo</h3><p style=\"font-size:0.9375rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.6\">Time-critical emergency freight services with immediate dispatch within 30 minutes, dual-driver teams, and direct hot-shot units.</p><ul style=\"list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.5rem\"><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Immediate Dispatch Guarantee within 30 Minutes of Booking</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Continuous Dual-Driver Team Motion (Non-Stop Transit)</span></li><li style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem;font-size:0.85rem;color:var(--color-text-main);font-weight:500\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check\" style=\"color:var(--color-success);flex-shrink:0\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Dedicated Hot-Shot Straight Trucks &amp; Sprinter Units</span></li></ul><div style=\"margin-top:auto;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between\"><span style=\"font-size:0.8125rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:600\">SLA: <!-- -->100% On-Time SLA or money-back expedite surcharge refund</span><a class=\"btn btn-outline\" style=\"padding:0.45rem 0.9rem;font-size:0.85rem\" href=\"/services/expedited-critical-freight\"><span>Technical Specs</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:5rem\"><div style=\"text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.78125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.4rem\">SERVICE BENCHMARK COMPARISON</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:1.5rem\">Side-by-Side Carrier SLA &amp; Equipment Matrix</h2><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-lg);border:1px solid var(--color-border);overflow-x:auto;box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.875rem;min-width:900px\"><thead><tr style=\"background-color:var(--color-primary);color:#FFFFFF;text-align:left\"><th style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600\">Service Line</th><th style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600\">Max Payload</th><th style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600\">Lead Time</th><th style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600\">Telematics Ping</th><th style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600\">Temp Precision</th><th style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600\">SLA Score</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background-color:#FFFFFF\"><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Full Truckload (FTL) 53’ Dry Van<span style=\"display:block;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:400\">High-Volume Retail &amp; Automotive Line Feed</span></td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-weight:500\">45,500 Lbs</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Same Day / 24 Hrs</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Every 15 Mins</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Ambient / N/A</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-success)\">99.6%</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background-color:var(--color-bg-main)\"><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Temperature-Controlled Cold Chain<span style=\"display:block;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:400\">Biopharmaceuticals, Vaccines &amp; Fresh Produce</span></td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-weight:500\">43,500 Lbs</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">24 - 48 Hrs</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Every 60 Secs (Satellite)</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">-20°F to +70°F (±0.5°F)</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-success)\">99.98% (Zero Excursion)</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background-color:#FFFFFF\"><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Heavy Haul &amp; Over-Dimensional<span style=\"display:block;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:400\">Transformers, Turbines &amp; Construction Rigging</span></td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-weight:500\">Up to 150,000 Lbs</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">48 - 72 Hrs (Permits)</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Every 5 Mins</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Ambient / N/A</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-success)\">100% Safety Guarantee</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background-color:var(--color-bg-main)\"><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Intermodal Rail Container<span style=\"display:block;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:400\">Long-Haul (&gt;750 Mi) CO2 &amp; Cost Reduction</span></td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-weight:500\">42,500 Lbs</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">48 Hrs Notice</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Every 1 Hour</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Ambient / Controlled</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-success)\">98.2%</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background-color:#FFFFFF\"><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Contract Warehousing &amp; Cross-Dock<span style=\"display:block;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:400\">Inventory Staging &amp; Retail Pool Distribution</span></td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-weight:500\">N/A (36’ Clear High-Bay)</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Immediate Pool Access</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Real-Time WMS (EDI 856)</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Climate-Controlled</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-success)\">99.95% Pick Accuracy</td></tr><tr style=\"border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background-color:var(--color-bg-main)\"><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary)\">Expedited Emergency Hot-Shot<span style=\"display:block;font-size:0.75rem;color:var(--color-text-muted);font-weight:400\">Assembly Line Shutdown Prevention &amp; Medical Emergency</span></td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);font-weight:500\">38,000 Lbs</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">&lt; 30 Mins Dispatch</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Continuous Real-Time Satellite</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary)\">Ambient / Temp Opt</td><td style=\"padding:1rem 1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-success)\">99.9%</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:5rem\"><div style=\"text-transform:uppercase;font-size:0.78125rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-accent);letter-spacing:0.08em;margin-bottom:0.4rem\">DISPATCH ARCHITECTURE</div><h2 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:2rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:2rem\">6-Step End-to-End Carrier Execution Protocol</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3, 1fr);gap:1.5rem\"><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><div style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-accent);font-family:var(--font-heading);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">01</div><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Automated Rate &amp; Asset Allocation</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5\">Shipper inputs origin/destination zips. Vanguardia TMS pings nearest terminal asset buffer and locks Class-8 power unit.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><div style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-accent);font-family:var(--font-heading);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">02</div><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Pre-Cooling &amp; Facility Sanitization</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5\">For cold chain assets, trailer Thermo King unit is remotely pre-cooled to target temp setpoint. Sanitization logs generated.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><div style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-accent);font-family:var(--font-heading);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">03</div><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Driver Arrival &amp; Geofence Check-In</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5\">Samsara satellite telematics automatically logs driver arrival at shipper dock, triggering real-time eBOL timestamping.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><div style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-accent);font-family:var(--font-heading);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">04</div><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">In-Transit Satellite Telemetry</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5\">Load pings location every 60s. Cold chain sensors record supply air, return air, and internal temp variance continuously.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><div style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-accent);font-family:var(--font-heading);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">05</div><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Automated Receiver Gate Alert</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5\">Receiving dock management system pings when trailer is 30, 10, and 0 minutes away to eliminate dock dwell time.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:var(--radius-md);padding:1.5rem;border:1px solid var(--color-border);box-shadow:var(--shadow-sm)\"><div style=\"font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;color:var(--color-accent);font-family:var(--font-heading);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">06</div><h4 style=\"font-family:var(--font-heading);font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--color-primary);margin-bottom:0.5rem\">eBOL Delivery &amp; Audit Proofing</h4><p style=\"font-size:0.875rem;color:var(--color-text-secondary);line-height:1.5\">Instant digital Proof of Delivery (POD) and temperature excursion audit reports delivered to shipper dashboard.</p></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"Footer_footer__eNA9m\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"Footer_footerGrid__Zjk4v\"><div class=\"Footer_brandCol__6UIwg\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:36px;height:36px;backgro